<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's exports hit $817 mln Dec 1-5 -- ministry.</title>
<headline>Brazil's exports hit $817 mln Dec 1-5 -- ministry.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil exported $817 million in the first five working days of December, with average daily exports of $163.4 million, the Ministry of Industry and Commerce said.</p>
</text>
